title: "PET-CT Radiomics Pipeline"
version: "anm-release-2026-10-14.1"
date-released: 2026-10-14
url: "https://github.com/haga-aki/pet-ct-radiomics-pipeline-public"
repository-code: "https://github.com/haga-aki/pet-ct-radiomics-pipeline-public"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - PET-CT
  - radiomics
  - TotalSegmentator
  - medical imaging
  - deep learning
  - IBSI
  - PyRadiomics
abstract: >-
  Standardized whole-body PET radiomics extraction using
  TotalSegmentator-derived CT masks transferred to the native PET grid.
  Uses the TotalSegmentator total task (117 mask files with v2.11.0),
  SUVbw conversion from standard DICOM BQML data with fail-closed timing
  checks, 107 PyRadiomics features (93 native-PET intensity and texture,
  14 CT-grid shape) described with IBSI terminology, and run-scoped
  technical QC reports.
